        "content": "I’m an AI, not a lawyer—this is a technical and operational assessment, not formal legal advice; have telecommunications/privacy counsel review your final calling policy before launch.\n\n**Yes:** I would be able to build an original, company-owned leasing lead dialer with the meaningful functions visible on Enzo’s public site. I recommend starting with a property-aware, compliance-first system for preview/click-to-call, controlled power dialing, follow-ups, dispositions, CRM/property-system sync, recordings, dashboards, and centralized opt-outs—not a high-volume 14-line predictive dialer.\n\nThe attached assessment documents the observed Enzo capabilities, a practical phased build scope, viable implementation paths, and the consent/DNC/caller-ID/recording safeguards that should be engineered into the product from day one."
